<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
Your ticket #{{ticketId}} that was drafted to swap #{{orderId}} was slashed
of {{amount}} {{asset}} because it <b>{{reason}}</b> in a dispute. <br><br>
The ticket has also been removed from the market. If the ticket still holds
enough bond, you can still re-join the market with it.
<br><br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/market/{{marketAddress}}">View Market</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
